B.bpX=new A.aY("We use PII to provide services that are helpful to you and assist you in your activities, improve the functioning of the MNO app, enable us to promote MNO app for offer more utility to you, personalise your experience of the MNO app, analyse the operation and usage of the app by you and other users, allow you to share your experiences with sellers and other entities with them and also share information with other users in the chat rooms. For illustration, if you share your comments and feedback with other users in the chat room, we may store your PII and those of the recipients. We may also use your PII to run a promotion, contest, survey, research or undertake other activities to inform you, interest you or understand you. Another possible usage could be we may use your email address to respond to queries, requests and other issues that may arise in your usage of the MNO app. Your PII will also be shared with concerned sellers and other third parties when resolving concerns that are raised by you.\n\nThere may be services that are provided by the MNO app for which we may fully or partially use the services of third parties. In these situations we will be sharing on those information that are necessary for the third parties to effectively provide the service to you. These could be, but not limited to, troubleshoot problems, operating the app, providing customer service and verifing PII.\n\nThere are situations when we may need to disclose PII. We will sharing such information with Judicial, Quasi-Judicial and law enforcement authorities, wherein we may believe in good faith it is necessary and/or obilatory to do so. These could include but not limited to, Court Orders, Judicial Proceedings, Civil and criminal Investigations and other legal process that is served on us. Further we could use this information to exercise our legal rights and defend against legal claims. We will reveal PII if it necessary to protect the rights of other users or general public, including their rights to property and personal safety. WIDE ANGLE may disclose information, in good faith, to other third pary owners when necessary to offer services to our users and also when necessary to enforce Our Terms of Use or Privacy Policy.",null,B.fC,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null)
